{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティーMV解禁!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に伴い、\nポジションもわかったかと思いますが\n3列目に帰ってまいりました！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"端っこ結構目立つし\nまひたんと一緒に後ろの端から\nパフォーマンス盛り上げるよ☻！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにシークレットグラフィティーの\n2番サビ終わりの\nUh～とかAh～とかは\nまひたんと2人で歌ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シングルは樋口くんに\n全力でついていくよ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてさらに白米様MVも\n解禁されました(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVにこんなに映るのは初めてで\nすごく嬉しいです(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔芸ばかりやらされたので\nすごい顔いっぱいしてるけど...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のファンの方は知ってると思うし、\n前にブログとかにも書いたこと\nあると思うんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が1番好きな食べ物は白米"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！\n玄米でもなくお肉でもなく白米！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんに寄せた歌詞だと思うけど、\nちゃっかり私にも、どストライクな歌詞！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVでは白米パフェとか\nたくさん食べられて\n幸せだったなあ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子が楽しそうでなにより。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日に放送されるニコ生で\nMVフル解禁予定でしたが\n急遽変更してニコ生では\nMVの裏側などスペシャル映像を\n流す予定です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7/24 19:30～です！観てね～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティーのセットに\nこんなものがあああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みつけられるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/07/21/7494795/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪ライブ頑張ります(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}